  content:02_4:02_4-download02.wav [open] proposed None
    script: "Multiplying by any complex number does two things at once. It stretches by that number's length and turns by its angle. Multiply by one plus i, and the plane grows by the square root of two and turns an eighth of a turn."
    bridge difference: replace 'turn' -> 'term'
