  content:03_2:03_2-download01.wav [notation] proposed proceed
    script: 'Start with squaring. Lengths multiply and angles add, so squaring squares each length and doubles each angle. Walk a point once around a circle of radius one half. Its image goes around a circle of radius one quarter, twice.'
    bridge difference: replace 'half' -> 'over two'
    bridge difference: replace 'quarter' -> 'over four'
